Thus, every language in \( \textbf{P} \) can be accommodated in \( \textbf{P}_{\text{bad-angel}} \) by trivializing the computation of \(\beta_n\) as irrelevant to the decision process, maintaining polynomial-time performance. Therefore, \( \textbf{P} \subseteq \textbf{P}_{\text{bad-angel}} \).

